{"question": "What is the average weight of NBA players", "sql": "SELECT AVG(CAST(SUBSTR(WT, 1, INSTR(WT,' ')-1) AS INTEGER) + CAST(SUBSTR(WT, INSTR(WT,' ')+1) AS FLOAT)/16) as average_weight FROM nba_roster WHERE WT!= '--';"}
