{"question": "What is the most frequently worn jersey number in the NBA", "sql": "SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT Jersey) AS total_jerseys, Jersey FROM nba_roster GROUP BY Jersey ORDER BY total_jerseys DESC LIMIT 1;"}
