{"question": "What is the average age of players in the NBA who have a total of 12 years of experience or less", "sql": "SELECT AVG(AGE) FROM nba_roster WHERE AGE * 12 * 5 <= (SELECT SUM(AGE * 12) FROM nba_roster);"}
